      "html": "<p>Walk round the truck, then test it. Check tyres and wheels. Forks and backrest. Mast, chains and rams for leaks. Brakes, including the parking brake. Steering. Horn. Lights and beacons. Seatbelt. Data plate. Warning lights and odd noises on start-up.</p><p>Quickler asks each item in WhatsApp. The operator answers and sends a photo of a split tyre or bent fork. The supervisor sees a fault at once. Adapt the list to your own trucks and site.</p>"
